      "text": "Keyboard input list has a single row (model 'Stereo DI') with no matching second row; per stereo-pairing rule this cannot be treated as a stereo pair (no two sequential rows), so it is patched as one mono channel. Flagging for human confirmation in case a second Keyboard input was omitted from the sheet.",
